            "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Market Compatible</h1><p><strong>NEW</strong> - Earn Mega Rats items in the game and then buy and sell them in the Steam Market!</p><br><h1>Inventory System Now Available</h1><p><strong>New inventory system</strong> can be<strong> spawned in 3D</strong> by pressing &quot;I&quot; in-game.  Use it to access earned or purchased <strong>Mega Rats Steam Items</strong> and <strong><u>equip them</u></strong>.</p><br><h1>Trade with the AI Humans</h1><p>Humans in Mega Rats can now trade items with you.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>The planet is under attack by <strong>Giant Rats</strong>.  We don't know where they came from, or why they're here.  <strong>Help the citizens of Mega Rats</strong> defend their cities.<br><br>Mega Rats is a <strong>fun filled</strong> and carefully crafted mix of fluid physical motion and hilarious <strong>Giant Rats</strong>. <br><br>Mixing gameplay aspects of a <strong>First Person Shooter</strong> with a <strong>3rd Person action adventure game</strong>, Mega Rats provides <strong>hours of fun</strong>. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the landscapes, discover cities, and defend the citizens, with full rigid body character physics in a <strong>large open world</strong>. <br></li><li>Enjoy <strong>smooth character contro</strong>l while immersing yourself in the visceral soundtrack accompanying Mega Rats.   <br></li><li>Mega Rats can be played in <strong>VR</strong>!</li></ul>Virtual Reality requires a supported Head Mounted Display (OSVR or SteamVR Compatible), but Mega Rats can also be played on 3D Televisions and regular 2D monitors.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534210/extras/7a2c7218aba20368e45c81085ed48252.avif?t=1487069047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534210/extras_big/7a2c7218aba20368e45c81085ed48252.avif?t=1487069047 width=800 height=450 /></span>",
