                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "When I first noticed [strike]Bad Rats[/strike] MegaRats expected EDF + Rats, unfortunately it's a broken mess atm. Not sure if touching walls, climbing pavement above 1inch in height or looking at the lamp posts the wrong way causes character to tumble out of control, but it's frustrating.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RPvR69KAsJM\nBelieve the aim of the game is to kill rats and collect coins. Since you are given what seems to be every weapon from the start, I'm still not sure why. NPCs were found in towns that are meant to shoot rats..? most just stood there and died. Half the towns were underwater, rats spawned out of nowhere and I didn't notice any obvious objectives or health bars. Basically left stumbling around some bizzare version of The Lost City of Atlantis until getting bored.\n\nShould really be labeled Early Access and halved in price for now. Still needs a lot of work. Performance is all over the place on a single 970 and i7. More then happy to take another look as updates happen, just can't recommend the game in it's current state.",
